ds":[{"surface":"அன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னன்","lemma":"அன்னன்","gloss":"such a person"}],"gloss":"such a person"},{"surface":"ஆகன்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகன்","lemma":"ஆகன்","gloss":"being"}],"gloss":"being","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாறே","parts":[{"text":"மாறு","lemma":"மாறு","gloss":"because of"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"because of indeed"},{"surface":"இந்நிலம்","parts":[{"text":"இந்நிலம்","lemma":"இந்நிலம்","gloss":"this land"}],"gloss":"this land","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இலம்படு","parts":[{"text":"இலம்","lemma":"இலம்","gloss":"poverty"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"suffer"}],"gloss":"suffering poverty"},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலம்","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புலம்பல்","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பல்","lemma":"புலம்பல்","gloss":"lamentation/poverty"}],"gloss":"lamentation"},{"surface":"போயின்று","parts":[{"text":"போயின்று","lemma":"போயின்று","gloss":"has gone"}],"gloss":"has gone","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பூத்த","parts":[{"text":"பூத்த","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"blossomed/flourished"}],"gloss":"flourished"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கடும்பே","parts":[{"text":"கடும்பு","lemma":"கடும்பு","gloss":"kinsfolk/family"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"my family indeed"}]}],"literal":"Wearing pearls from the southern ocean / rubbing sandalwood from the northern hills / ... ocean-like army / with sweet-sounding victorious strength / the strong warrior of the Southerners / the water poured on the heights spreading to the ocean and becoming pearls / fragrant-petaled wild jasmine along with kootalam flowers withering / clarifying ... flowing / the lord of Nanjil hill with sweet-carpeled jackfruit trees / to those who oppose with enmity, he is far away and unthinking / to those who approach with friendship, he is close as the palm of the hand / Kandan of the strong spear, not only of good fame / ... garlanded young children / because he is such a person, even if this land / suffers poverty in these times / my family's lamentation has gone and we have flourished.","translation":"Wearing pearls from the southern ocean and smeared with sandalwood from the northern hills, the strong warrior of the southern king commands an ocean-like army of sweet-sounding victory. On his Nanjil hills, where sweet-carpeled jackfruit grows, the rain that falls on the heights flows down to the ocean to become pearls, while fragrant wild jasmine and kootalam flowers wither in the rushing streams. To those who oppose him with enmity, Kandan of the strong spear is distant and unreachable; but to those who approach him in friendship, he is as close and open as the palm of one's hand. Because he is such a generous lord, even if this entire land falls into poverty, the suffering of my family has vanished, and we have flourished.","modern":"தெற்குக் கடலின் முத்தை அணிந்து, வடமலையின் சந்தனத்தைப் பூசி, கடல் போன்ற படையுடன் விளங்கும் பாண்டியனின் சிறந்த வீரன் அவன். பலா மரங்கள் நிறைந்த நாஞ்சில் மலையின் தலைவனான அவனது மலையில் பெய்யும் மழைநீர், காட்டு மல்லிகையையும் கூதளத்தையும் சிதைத்து ஓடி, கடலை அடைந்து முத்தாக மாறும். பகைவர்களுக்கு எட்டாத தொலைவில் இருக்கும் அவன், நண்பர்களுக்கு உள்ளங்கை போல நெருக்கமானவன். வேலேந்திய கந்தன் அத்தகைய வள்ளலாக இருப்பதால், இந்நாடு வறுமையுற்ற காலத்திலும் என் சுற்றத்தாரின் வறுமை நீங்கி நாங்கள் செழிப்படைந்தோம்.","explanation":"This poem from Purananuru is in the Patan tinai, where the poet Karuvur Kocentanaṟ praises the chieftain Kandan of Nanjil hill. The poet describes Kandan as a mighty warrior of the Pandya king, wearing southern pearls and northern sandalwood. He is depicted as a dual personality: extremely distant and fierce to his enemies, but as close and open as the palm of one's hand to his friends and bards. The rich landscape of Nanjil hill, where rain on the peaks washes down jasmine and kootalam flowers to the ocean, mirrors his boundless generosity. Because of Kandan's great patronage, the poet's family has completely overcome their poverty and flourished, even if the rest of the land suffers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.11,0.34],[0.34,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.23,3.37],[3.37,3.5],[3.5,4.2],[4.2,4.6],[4.75,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.64],[6.64,6.64],[6.64,7.2],[7.2,7.5],[7.5,7.6],[7.6,8.7],[8.7,9.4],[9.4,10.0],[10.14,10.7],[10.7,11.87],[11.87,12.3],[12.3,12.8],[12.8,13.0],[13.0,13.5],[13.7,14.0],[14.72,15.32],[15.32,15.52],[15.52,15.92],[15.92,16.22],[16.35,16.42],[16.42,16.42],[16.42,16.42],[16.42,16.62],[16.62,20.24],[20.46,21.12],[21.12,21.12],[21.12,22.28],[22.28,22.28],[22.28,22.28],[22.28,22.56],[22.56,23.72],[23.72,24.62],[24.62,25.25],[25.25,25.52],[25.52,25.88],[26.0,26.24],[26.24,26.72],[26.72,27.22],[27.22,27.84],[28.22,28.72],[28.77,28.92],[28.92,30.02],[30.08,30.32],[30.32,31.12],[31.12,31.52]],"female":[[0.0,0.36],[0.36,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.41,3.53],[3.53,3.99],[3.99,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.73],[5.82,6.0],[6.0,7.19],[7.19,7.19],[7.19,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.8],[13.8,14.2],[14.38,14.55],[14.72,15.6],[16.44,17.04],[17.04,17.34],[17.34,17.74],[17.74,18.14],[18.14,18.87],[18.87,19.35],[19.71,20.2],[20.32,21.04],[21.04,22.24],[22.24,22.42],[22.42,23.14],[23.14,23.54],[23.54,24.64],[24.64,24.74],[24.74,25.64],[25.71,25.94],[25.94,26.94],[26.94,27.71],[27.71,28.04],[28.04,28.84],[28.84,29.24],[29.24,29.34],[29.34,29.64],[29.64,30.84],[30.84,31.64],[31.64,32.04],[32.04,32.73],[33.0,33.64],[33.64,34.24],[34.24,34.74]]},"sync":[[["தென்","south"]],[["பவ்வத்து","of the ocean"]],[["முத்து","pearl"],["பூண்டு","having worn"]],[["பூண்டு","having worn"]],[["வட","north"]],[["குன்றத்து","of the hill"],["சாந்தம்","sandalwood"]]